theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 9
text = "There is a blinding flash of light and a wave of intense heat that feels like it is burning you from the inside, and then as you lay on the floor stunned you hear her voice. 
She doesn't remember what happens and you come up with some explaination that it was a mixup at the hospital, and she had amnesia. 
She is exactly how you remember her, perhaps too much like you remember her. 
Sometimes you walk into a room and catch her just standing there, like a statue. At night you can feel her watching you sleep. 
Perhaps you brought her back, or perhaps you brought back something else..."
